    <rigor-reason>Edits shared `Services/Communication/ThreadResolver.cs` (`BuildTopic` re-derive) on the persist/resolve path AND places a PCF on the shared thread form; touches `.cs` + a `pcf` config surface. FULL protocol + Step 9.5 gates required. `parallel-safe: true` because it lands strictly AFTER 070 (its blocker) serializes the shared-resolver edit — but it still runs `/conflict-check` before the PR (shared `Services/Communication/` hot-path).</rigor-reason>
