    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates (REQUIRED — shared-resolver edit + form surface): `code-review` on the diff (focus: marker gate correct [user edits preserved], no second regarding mechanism ADR-046, additive NFR-04, NFR-02 non-fatal, PCF 0-code + bound field, read path untouched); `adr-check` against `spec.md`. Address Critical findings; cite Placement Justification. Per root §6.5, surface any ADR tension.</step>
    <step order="10">Run `/conflict-check` before the PR (shared `Services/Communication/` hot-path — after 070). Then update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (071 ✅) + reset `current-task.md`; record decisions (marker-flip mechanism, re-derive trigger, PCF binding field, form placement).</step>
