    Depends on 002 (naming-edited marker + Lookup discriminator + typed lookups) + 070 (same-file shared-resolver edit landed first). The marker-flip mechanism (who sets "edited" on a user rename — BFF write path vs a plugin/flow) is the one execution-time ambiguity: DECIDE it explicitly and document it (root §6), do not leave it implicit.

